desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Deprecated Use Bitwise"
	title_zh: "Deprecated Use Bitwise"
	type: audit
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-best-practice-deprecated_use_bitwise"
	risk: "best-practice"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
The syntax `use Bitwise` is already deprecated. Please use `import Bitwise` instead.

### 风险类型
最佳实践（best-practice）

### 影响
代码或配置不符合推荐实践，长期来看可能引入安全或维护风险。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按官方推荐方式改写，并补充必要的安全配置。

推荐修复：
import Bitwise
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ex": <<<POS
use Bitwise
POS
	"safefile://pos.ex": <<<NEG
import Bitwise
NEG
)

${*.ex}.pattern_regex(/(?:use\s+Bitwise)/) as $p0
${*.exs}.pattern_regex(/(?:use\s+Bitwise)/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Deprecated Use Bitwise",
	title_zh: "Deprecated Use Bitwise",
	message: "Deprecated Use Bitwise detected.",
}
